DESCRIPTION >
    Hourly rollup of direct Agent Message usage and cost, by org/source/model/repo,
    over the canonical agent_priced_usage view. COPY_MODE replace swaps the whole
    target so a re-parse or replay can never leave a stale bucket. Reads the
    direct-message rows of the view (subagent fallback usage is uncosted and surfaces
    only in agent_sessions coverage), so CostUsd agrees with agent_sessions by
    construction. Hourly cadence (not the proxy's 10-min) sized to the one-year fact TTL.

NODE rollup
SQL >
    SELECT
        toStartOfHour(toDateTime(EventAt)) AS BucketStart,
        OrgId,
        source,
        model,
        repo_fingerprint,
        countState() AS MessageCount,
        uniqState(session_pk) AS SessionCount,
        sumState(input_tokens) AS InputTokens,
        sumState(output_tokens) AS OutputTokens,
        sumState(cache_read_tokens) AS CacheReadTokens,
        sumState(cache_creation_tokens) AS CacheCreationTokens,
        sumState(reasoning_tokens) AS ReasoningTokens,
        sumState(toUInt64(cost_usd IS NOT NULL)) AS PricedMessageCount,
        sumState(ifNull(cost_usd, 0.)) AS CostUsd
    FROM agent_priced_usage
    WHERE usage_kind = 'direct'
    GROUP BY BucketStart, OrgId, source, model, repo_fingerprint

TYPE COPY
TARGET_DATASOURCE agent_usage_1h
COPY_SCHEDULE */10 * * * *
COPY_MODE replace
